\pard\plain \tx0\tx360\tx720\tx1080\tx1440\tx1800\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\fi360\ltrch\loch {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 The town hall echoes with the echoes of shoes walking and screeching through its black and white tiles. Eddie sat at one of the wooden bench, it\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92s been hours.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Is the test always this long?\u8221\'94 He asked to the man next to him.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93No,\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Then why is this one?\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93An \u8216\'91Expert\u8217\'92 usually do not ask for local assistant, so there\u8217\'92s a lot of new elements here.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Eddie sighed, and slumped deeper into the wooden desk in boredom.}}